        "id": "3c2dbb424ba3d4f71e8521925b49bc901505094b",
        "tree_id": "b5d8b1aadfb052771095261d12c8a25e79fa932f",
        "message": "App Builder: live preview, Chronos kit, design editor, storage and security fixes\n\nLive preview\n- Compile the generated workspace in a sandboxed iframe (Sucrase + esm.sh) and\n  render it while files stream in; planned files show placeholders.\n- Generation is a server-side run the page re-attaches to after a reload;\n  pages generate in parallel after shared files; App.tsx routes and the kit\n  sidebar are wired as pages land; JSX in .ts data files is saved as .tsx.\n- Preview toolbar: routes, device widths, light/dark, console with\n  \"Fix with AI\" on compile/render errors.\n\nChronos kit and 3D icons\n- Ship a ported Chronos UI kit (AppShell, PageHeader, Panel, KpiTile,\n  DataTable, Chart, Mark, ...) in every generated app; prompts compose it, so\n  pages are much shorter. Kit is hardened against bad props, sections are\n  error-bounded, components accept className (tailwind-merge), and apps with\n  an older kit are upgraded when opened.\n- Unified 3D icon library (~920 icons from the Wayam library, Manthan, Setu,\n  WayamEye, Chronos) with a manifest; prompts get relevant icons only; used\n  icons are bundled into downloads and pushes.\n\nDesign tab\n- Visual edit: click to select (kit components map to the page that used\n  them), edit text in place, typography/fill/border/spacing controls, 3D icon\n  picker, parent select, undo/redo, Ask AI per element.\n- Theme editor: token-level presets, brand colour, surfaces, default mode,\n  status and chart colours, fonts and radius, written to src/design.css and\n  design.json for both the preview and the shipped app.\n\nApps and storage\n- Every App Builder file is mirrored to MongoDB and restored when the disk\n  copy is gone; \"Your apps\" list with open/delete; download as zip.\n\nResponsive layout, charts, dropdowns and naming\n- Kit sizes itself: KPI figures scale to the tile width and value length,\n  labels wrap, KpiGrid/Grid choose their own column count, page titles are\n  fluid; prompts require these layouts.\n- Charts ported from Wayam UI: line/area/bar/combo, donut with centre total,\n  sparkline, gauge, progress ring and bars, funnel, bullet, chart card.\n- Custom keyboard-accessible dropdown in the kit; styled dropdowns in the\n  Design tab.\n- Plain tool names (App Studio, Code Workspace, Product Specs, Sprint\n  Health, CI Health, ...) and plain names for generated apps.\n- Planner writes per-page blueprints; failed builds are repaired once\n  automatically.\n\nSecurity and correctness\n- Fix path traversal in chain analysis, .git access through workspace files,\n  PAT left in clone config, token written to App Builder .git/config, push\n  rejections reported as success, empty-path workspace wipe, login lockout\n  bypass via X-Forwarded-For, SSRF error echo, and several wrong status codes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
